    {
      "statement": "The bounded with/without upkeep pair finishes locally; each repeats index/check after a byte snapshot and leaves context Markdown unchanged",
      "stage": "behavior"
    },
    {
      "statement": "Handoff and BUILD report observed results, their limits, and a current next step",
